OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest as woman killed in
OL,4,Astreet stabbing named
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was found dead in a
OL,7,Fstabbing on a street in Manchester has
OL,8,Fbeen named by police.
OL,10,FAlisha Samuels, 26, was pronounced dead
OL,11,Fat the scene after police responded to
OL,12,Fa "disturbance" on Dorking Avenue in
OL,13,Fthe Newton Heath area of the city at
OL,14,Fabout 02:00 BST.
OL,16,FA 25-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of her murder, while another
OL,18,Fman, 61 and woman, 38, were arrested on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of assisting an offender,
OL,20,FGreater Manchester Police said.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
